From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:01:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: sc8280xp: no headset jack on MI2S links

MI2S links on these boards drive speaker amplifiers; do not create
Headphone Jack / Mic Jack controls for them.

Co-Authored-By: Grok <noreply@x.ai>
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
index 1e4cd7901..90279e1fc 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
@@ -50,7 +50,8 @@ static int sc8280xp_snd_init(struct snd_soc_pcm_runtime *rtd)
 		snd_soc_runtime_set_dai_fmt(rtd, SND_SOC_DAIFMT_I2S |
 					    SND_SOC_DAIFMT_NB_NF |
 					    SND_SOC_DAIFMT_BC_FC);
-		break;
+		/* No headset behind an MI2S amplifier link. */
+		return 0;
 	case DISPLAY_PORT_RX_0:
 		/* DISPLAY_PORT dai ids are not contiguous */
 		dp_pcm_id = 0;
-- 
2.55.0

